Public datasets (connect_tycoon/data/profiles/general.json, connect_tycoon/data/real/)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The "general" company profile contains summary statistics (weekday shares, quantile tables, rates)
computed by scripts/calibrate.py. No raw records are redistributed except where noted.
  · Online Retail II — Chen, D. (2019), UCI Machine Learning Repository, CC BY 4.0. https://doi.org/10.24432/C5CG6D
  · Hotel Booking Demand — Antonio, N., Almeida, A. & Nunes, L. (2019), Data in Brief 22, CC BY 4.0
    (via rfordatascience/tidytuesday 2020-02-11).
  · Bike Sharing — Fanaee-T, H. (2013), UCI Machine Learning Repository, CC BY 4.0. https://doi.org/10.24432/C5W894
  · Credit Card Fraud Detection — Machine Learning Group, ULB (Dal Pozzolo et al. 2015), Database Contents License v1.0
    (OpenML dataset 1597). data/real/card_queue.json holds 713 derived rows (model score, rescaled amount, fraud label)
    from the held-out half of this dataset.
  · Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset by Olist — CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Only three aggregate review-score shares
    (on-time / late / failed orders) are used; these determine sat_base and stockout_dsat.
  · Bitext Customer Support LLM Chatbot Training Dataset — CDLA-Sharing-1.0. Only intent counts are used.
data/real/demand_days.json holds normalized daily demand ratios derived from Online Retail II, Hotel Booking Demand
and Bike Sharing (CC BY 4.0).
